<title>PERU: Peru's Cementos Lima SA 11-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>Peru's Cementos Lima SA 11-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending November 30.</p>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 66.3 million soles vs 65.6 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 332.1 million soles vs 325.4 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Cementos Lima is Peru's largest cement firm. Its non-voting labor shares are considered blue chips on the Lima stock exchange.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
